    输出(";  写→MemTable(SkipList)→Immutable→SSTable(磁盘)\n");
    输出(";  SSTable=数据块+索引块+Bloom Filter\n");
    输出(";  Compaction: Leveled(10x/层) | Tiered(大小合并) | Universal(RocksDB)\n");
